agent-chrome is original code written for this repository, with behavior and some
logic adapted (translated from Python to JavaScript) from:

  browser-use/browser-harness, version 0.1.13 (PyPI sdist sha256
  284dc547a042c309feafd9a9f4a74b2a8651b7963ea3ac6cb2f2d64889f6a8f3; GitHub tree
  a83c0be1fe1eddd8da5d440ee4a9324910ee6f7c), src/browser_harness/helpers.py:
  US-layout key mapping, framework-aware fill, network-idle wait, iframe evaluation,
  illegal-return retry, and the SKILL.md guidance on when (not) to use a browser.

Not carried over: telemetry, cloud browsers/auth, profile sync, update checks,
recording/video, the background daemon, automatic browser discovery, http_get.

